{"name":"GDLM 68 camera lab","desc":"Fly up and down! Flying portals low, middle and high, open sky and corridors: how GD's camera moves. Record it.","lab":[{"n":1,"name":"cube: stairs, drop, pad","from":22,"to":70,"metrics":[{"m":"alive"}],"note":"cube camera: climb 6 blocks (jump each step), walk off the top (a 6-block drop), then a yellow pad throws you up ~4 blocks. GD's cube camera follows the player up and down; the viewer's own camera is the thing being fitted"},{"n":2,"name":"ship LOW, open sky","from":70,"to":116,"metrics":[{"m":"alive"}],"note":"ship portal on the floor (row 1, y 45): sim band 0-300. Fly to the top and the bottom, slowly and fast: no blocks, so only the band and the camera bound you"},{"n":3,"name":"ship HIGH, open sky","from":116,"to":180,"metrics":[{"m":"alive"}],"note":"ship portal high on a 6-block tower (row 8, y 255): sim band 90-390: the band starts 3 blocks up, so the floor of the band is in the air. Fly up and down to its edges"},{"n":4,"name":"ship from a pad (rising), corridor","from":180,"to":224,"metrics":[{"m":"alive"}],"note":"a yellow pad throws you up through a ship portal in the air (row 3, y 105: rising entry; sim band 0-300), then a corridor (floor row 2, roof row 8) for 16 blocks: does the camera stop following inside it?"},{"n":5,"name":"UFO from a pad (falling)","from":224,"to":266,"metrics":[{"m":"alive"}],"note":"a yellow pad's arc comes DOWN through a UFO portal (row 2, y 75: falling entry; sim band 0-300). Then tap to fly up and down"},{"n":6,"name":"UFO HIGH","from":266,"to":328,"metrics":[{"m":"alive"}],"note":"UFO portal high (row 9, y 285, on a 6-block tower): sim band 120-420. Flap up to the top, let it fall to the bottom"},{"n":7,"name":"swing LOW, corridor","from":328,"to":376,"metrics":[{"m":"alive"}],"note":"swing on the floor (row 1: sim band 0-300): open for 14 blocks, then a corridor (floor row 2, roof row 7) for 16"},{"n":8,"name":"swing HIGH","from":376,"to":436,"metrics":[{"m":"alive"}],"note":"swing portal high (row 8, y 255, on a tower): sim band 90-390"},{"n":9,"name":"wave MID (rising), open","from":436,"to":478,"metrics":[{"m":"alive"}],"note":"a pad throws you up into a wave portal (row 3, rising: sim band 0-300); hold and let go to zigzag the full height, open sky"},{"n":10,"name":"wave corridor","from":478,"to":518,"metrics":[{"m":"alive"}],"note":"wave in a corridor (floor row 3, roof row 7; entered on the floor: sim band 0-300): small zigzags inside it"},{"n":11,"name":"ship VERY HIGH, open sky","from":518,"to":594,"metrics":[{"m":"alive"}],"note":"ship portal very high (row 11, y 345, on a 9-block tower): sim band 180-480: the whole band is above the ground's top. Fly to both edges"}],"objects":[[914,22,6.5,{"props":{"31":"MSBjdWJlOiBjbGltYiB0aGUgc3RhaXJzLCBkcm9wLCByaWRlIHRoZSBwYWQ=","32":"0.5"}}],
